angeInManagement1">Executive Director</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:PositionOfDirectorInBoardTwo contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Not Applicable</in-capmkt:PositionOfDirectorInBoardTwo><in-capmkt:PositionOfDirectorInBoardThree contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">WTD</in-capmkt:PositionOfDirectorInBoardThree><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Sankaran G</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-11-13</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1" unitRef="pure" decimals="INF">36</in-capmkt:TermOfAppointmentInMonths><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Shri Sankaran G aged 52 years is a B.Sc., graduate with MBA and JAIIB. He joined the Bank as a clerk on 16-03-1995 and rose to the position of the Executive President. He has over 30 years of experience working in the Bank and worked in various capacities in Computer Systems department [‘CSD’] including the Chief Information Officer [‘CIO’], ISSM and CISO. With his expertise, he has been very instrumental in many technology developments of the Bank inter-alia modernization of systems in branches, digital growth from 7% to 98%, resilience in cyber security, alternate channel implementation and digital lending. He has core competencies in almost all facets of Banking including IT &amp; ITES, Cyber Security, Digital transformation, building strategies – IT &amp; Non-IT and Business Process Re-engineering. Shri G Sankaran holds special knowledge to represent the majority sectors in the areas of Banking, Payment &amp; Settlement Systems and Information Technology and Cyber Security.

 

Shri Sankaran G has achieved notable recognitions in technology for the Bank &amp; digital excellence reflecting the strategic impact.

 

Shri Sankaran G is associated with following organizations at present:


1.       Member of Steering Committee at NPCI

2.       CAB– Advisory Member

3.       Palo Alto/ Manage Engine – Customer Advisory Member

4.       Bharath DB – IITM Pravartak - Advisory Member

5.       IBEX– Advisory Member

6.       Speaker at major banking forums

7.       Engagement with RBI, IDRBT, RBIH, NPCI – GFF</in-capmkt:BriefProfile><in-capmkt:DisclosureOfRelationshipsBetweenDirectorsInCaseOfAppointmentOfDirector contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Not Applicable</in-capmkt:DisclosureOfRelationshipsBetweenDirectorsInCaseOfAppointmentOfDirector><in-capmkt:AffirmationThatThePersonProposedToBeAppointedAsDirectorIsNotDebarredFromHoldingTheOfficeByVirtueOfAnySEBIOrderOrAnyOtherAuthority contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">true</in-capmkt:AffirmationThatThePersonProposedToBeAppointedAsDirectorIsNotDebarredFromHoldingTheOfficeByVirtueOfAnySEBIOrderOrAnyOtherAuthority><in-capmkt:WhetherTheDirectorBeingAppointedIsDisqualifiedFromHoldingTheOfficeOfDirectorPursuantToProvisionsOfSection164OfTheCompaniesAct2013 contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">false</in-capmkt:WhetherTheDirectorBeingAppointedIsDisqualifiedFromHoldingTheOfficeOfDirectorPursuantToProvisionsOfSection164OfTheCompaniesAct2013></xbrli:xbrl>
